        "# Generator expression\n",
        "\n",
        "A generator expression creates an iterator that produces values lazily, using syntax such as `(x*x for x in range(3))`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-generator-expression)"
      ]
